WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.650
asa cafe. App demo with synthetic data. Generic sample cafes and illustrated photos. Map tiles from OpenStreetMap.

2
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.400
Discover cafes as a guest, no account needed

3
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:06.350
Filter to what is open right now

4
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.650
Each card carries a short note and an open badge

5
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.100
A cafe page: open badge, amenities, best sellers and hours

6
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.450
The map pins every cafe in the directory

7
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.900
Tap a pin to open that cafe

8
00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:16.050
Want to save this cafe?

9
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.550
Only now does the app ask you to log in

10
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.250
asa cafe. Real app running locally as a guest on synthetic cafe data. Login shown, never submitted.

